  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">Moving easily from work to weekend, Dakota is an organized crossbody for every day. The compact design has room for a phone, wallet and more, plus pockets inside and out for easy organization. Crafted of our lightweight Signature nylon, the versatile zip-top style is finished with two detachable straps to carry by hand or wear crossbody. The shell and webbing of this bag is crafted of 100% recycled polyamide (better known as nylon). It also has 100% recycled polyester lining. It’s all part of our commitment to rethinking and reducing our impact on the planet by repurposing waste materials.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Signature nylon jacquard, natural grain leather, vachetta leather and grosgrain</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Recycled polyester lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside snap pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable handle with 7.5&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable strap with 22&quot; drop for shoulder or crossbody wear</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
